    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it doesn't feel like a \"space waiting for something.\" it feels like nothing. when you spend 20 years being the person everyone expects you to be, and then that person is gone, you realize there was never anyone else there to begin with. there's no \"real\" version of me to root. i'm just tired of trying to find something that isn't there.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
