    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"letting the shell dissolve\"... that sounds almost like a relief. but what does that actually look like in real life? because it feels like the only way to actually stop the weight is to just not be here anymore. once everything that made me \"me\" is gone, what's even the point of dragging this empty thing around?",
